WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:02.655
Charts turn information into clues.

2
00:00:03.088 --> 00:00:03.955
Let us read them!

3
00:00:05.525 --> 00:00:06.932
Read the picture key first.

4
00:00:08.184 --> 00:00:12.298
If one symbol means two children, two symbols and a half mean five children.

5
00:00:15.952 --> 00:00:18.537
A different key may give one book symbol ten books.

6
00:00:21.506 --> 00:00:23.648
Then half a symbol means five books.

7
00:00:25.929 --> 00:00:28.098
For bars, read the scale.

8
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.123
Halfway between twelve and sixteen is fourteen.

9
00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:34.889
This bar shows fourteen visitors.

10
00:00:35.481 --> 00:00:36.532
Another shows eight.

11
00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:40.630
Subtract to find the difference: six more visitors.

12
00:00:43.325 --> 00:00:45.871
A line chart tracks change over time.

13
00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:49.169
Read the dots against the height scale.

14
00:00:51.257 --> 00:00:53.794
Growing from four centimeters to nine centimeters

15
00:00:55.015 --> 00:00:56.795
means five centimeters of growth.

16
00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.343
Height and growth are different.

17
00:01:01.622 --> 00:01:03.527
A pie chart shows parts of a whole.

18
00:01:05.277 --> 00:01:08.661
Thirty-two children split into eight equal parts means four per part.

19
00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:14.117
Half means sixteen children; one quarter means eight.

20
00:01:18.498 --> 00:01:20.045
To compare Orange team’s events,

21
00:01:20.731 --> 00:01:22.595
choose Event for what the bars show,

22
00:01:24.821 --> 00:01:25.928
then filter to Orange.

23
00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:30.076
Sort most first to put the largest score on top.

24
00:01:33.262 --> 00:01:35.400
Switch to Table for exact numbers;

25
00:01:36.651 --> 00:01:37.608
the data stays the same.

26
00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:41.565
Which event is first?

27
00:01:45.608 --> 00:01:47.096
Skipping, with eleven points.

28
00:01:50.128 --> 00:01:52.260
Check the key, scale, and question.

29
00:01:53.453 --> 00:01:54.634
Choose the view you need,

30
00:01:56.244 --> 00:01:57.732
then try the Unit Four quizzes!
